OL,3,GNEWSAStaff strike at primary school
OL,4,Awithout home
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrimary school pupils have joined
OL,7,Fparents and teachers on the picket line
OL,8,Fin a dispute over excessive workload
OL,9,Fand compensation.
OL,11,FStaff at Sacred Heart Catholic Primary
OL,12,Fin Barrow-in-Furness, Cumbria, had to
OL,13,Fevacuate the school in January 2023
OL,14,Fwhen a routine inspection found the
OL,15,Ffloor was rotten and at risk of
OL,16,Fcollapse.
