OL,3,GNEWSAStaff strike at primary school
OL,4,Awithout home
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince then, staff have worked across
OL,7,Fmultiple sites under what they describe
OL,8,Fas exceptional working arrangements.
OL,9,FMembers of the National Association of
OL,10,FHead Teachers (NAHT) walked out earlier
OL,11,Fand are due to do the same on
OL,12,FWednesday.
OL,14,FFurther strike action is planned for 9
OL,15,Fand 10 November at the school, which is
OL,16,Fpart of the Mater Christi Trust.
